tes, deletes, extends volumes, makes snapshots","A single metadata writer rules out write conflicts","SDM: some operations run on any host holding a lease on the volume"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"engine\nappoints","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"engine\nappoints","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"SPM\none host","tone":"violet","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"violet","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"engine\nappoints","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"SPM\none host","tone":"violet","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"violet","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":224.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"volume\nmetadata","tone":"yellow","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a2","x1":174.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":185.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"engine\nappoints","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"SPM\none host","tone":"violet","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"violet","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":224.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"volume\nmetadata","tone":"yellow","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a2","x1":174.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":185.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":313.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"SDM:\nany host","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a3","x1":263.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":274.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}]],"cues":[10.6,25.6,33.9]}]},{"title":"sanlock and leases","sub":"Chapter 20 · oVirt storage","short":"sanlock","main":"Leases stop two hosts from owning one resource.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["host id","Renewal","Resources","Loss"],"captions":["A host gets a number (host id) in the domain and registers it in ids","The host renews its lease regularly; without renewal it expires in about 80 seconds","Leases are held by the SPM, volumes, and machines","A host cut from storage is rebooted by the watchdog"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"host id in the domain's ids area","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"host id in the domain's ids area","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"renewal, expiry ~80 s","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"host id in the domain's ids area","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"renewal, expiry ~80 s","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"leases: SPM, volumes, VMs","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"host id in the domain's ids area","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"renewal, expiry ~80 s","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"leases: SPM, volumes, VMs","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"no contact: watchdog reboot","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[10.4,23.0,30.3]}]},{"title":"Formats and thin allocation","sub":"Chapter 20 · oVirt storage","short":"Formats","main":"raw or qcow2, preallocated or thin; on block storage the volume grows by a threshold.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["raw","qcow2","File","Block"],"captions":["raw: just the bytes of the disk, simple and fast","qcow2 (COW): tables, snapshots, thin allocation","File domain: thin is a sparse file that grows by itself","Block domain: qcow2 in a small LV, VDSM extends it when free space drops below a threshold"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"raw\nbytes of the disk","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"raw\nbytes of the disk","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"qcow2 (COW)\nsnapshots, thin","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"raw\nbytes of the disk","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"qcow2 (COW)\nsnapshots, thin","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"file:\nsparse","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"raw\nbytes of the disk","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"qcow2 (COW)\nsnapshots, thin","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"file:\nsparse","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":265.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"block: LV grows\nby threshold","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[9.3,18.3,28.9]}]},{"title":"Volume chains","sub":"Chapter 20 · oVirt storage","short":"Chains","main":"Base, snapshots, leaf; reads go top-down, a merge removes a link.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Base","Snapshot","Leaf","Merge"],"captions":["The base is the first volume with no parent; a template is a base for linked clones","A snapshot freezes the leaf, which becomes an internal volume","The new leaf takes all writes; a read goes down to the first volume with the block","A live merge removes a link without stopping the VM; long chains slow reads"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"base\nroot","tone":"muted","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"base\nroot","tone":"muted","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"snapshot\nread-only","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"base\nroot","tone":"muted","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"snapshot\nread-only","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":224.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"leaf\nwrites","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a2","x1":174.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":185.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"base\nroot","tone":"muted","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"snapshot\nread-only","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":224.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"leaf\nwrites","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_si